Node ID=20 The Offer
Text=A certain water witch lives in these parts, causing our clan no end of trouble. It so happens that her magic is especially potent against our kind, making removing her more of a nuisance than she warrants.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=Grumdjun Have Darsh quest to kill Dryad
Reply Text=Darsh is worth the life of a Dryad. If this must be done, then so be it.
