Node ID=40 River Dryad
Text=The witch is a River Dryad, the last of the loathsome good forest folk we have had the privilege of exterminating. Her underhanded tactics and magic have butchered...several of my brethren who were merely trying to devour the candy-coated fairy creatures of this grove.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=Grumdjun Have Darsh quest to kill Dryad
Reply Text=Darsh is worth the life of a Dryad.  If this must be done, then so be it.
