Node ID=80 Magic Node
Text=You will discover these peculiar structures scattered across the land. We do not know their origin, which predates our arrival in these climes, but many believe that they are the magic teeth of Gurukal, the all powerful Goblin Lord.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=81 Magic Node
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=81 Magic Node
Text=I distrust these tales, however, and I have reason to believe that they are accumulations of magic, the discarded residue of old spells. This would account for their decidedly random nature.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=Grumdjun reverse checker Have Accepted Quest
Reply Text=I'm off to kill her. I will return for my reward.
Go to node ID=100 Goodbye Accept the offer
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Thought 80+
Reply Text=They are not residue, they are reservoirs. Magic collects in them the way water collects in a cistern, and it can be drawn back out by anyone who knows how to ask.
