Node ID=11 fellow pedant
Text=<He stops. The theatrical sneer slips, and for a moment there is only a very well-read goblin standing in a swamp.> ...Bonecrusher wrote nothing down. Yes. In eleven years no human has once asked me which of them I had actually read. <He recovers.> It signifies nothing. Your brain would still be improved by cooking.
