Node ID=82 the residue theory
Text=<He listens all the way to the end without once interrupting, which for Grumdjum is close to a religious experience.> Reservoirs. Not the leavings of magic but the keeping of it. <A long pause.> I have been wrong about this for a very long time and I find I mind it far less than I expected. Do not tell the Khan. He has me down as an authority.
